{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ESSOMENIC is a story-driven psychological horror centered around peering into people's minds. <strong>What can be found in their memories, and what can you hide in theirs?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057180/extras/90c4eeb6b34955f1ae319d0b5f1f8eee.avif?t=1760548385\" width=600 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057180/extras/ff91c76d7a96bfe2d03923fb52f53b48.poster.avif?t=1760548385\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057180/extras/ff91c76d7a96bfe2d03923fb52f53b48.webm?t=1760548385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057180/extras/ff91c76d7a96bfe2d03923fb52f53b48.mp4?t=1760548385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patients on your operating table are loaded into the <i>DREAMCATCHER</i>, a brutish and unconventional machine, in which their memories are projected onto a display. As the Doctor, you can traverse these memories, exploring the dreamscape within, finding out about the patient\u2019s past, about the work they\u2019re doing. When information from your contractor is lacking due to logistics, finding out anything new is welcome.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057180/extras/4cca370080ce83cc16981a381fb6734f.avif?t=1760548385\" width=600 height=75 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057180/extras/419c852a9089c2a6112bb801f41b346d.poster.avif?t=1760548385\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057180/extras/419c852a9089c2a6112bb801f41b346d.webm?t=1760548385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057180/extras/419c852a9089c2a6112bb801f41b346d.mp4?t=1760548385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But reliving these memories puts the patient at great risk. As the patient grows stressed, a crisis arises. Hormonal imbalance, neuronal breakdowns, and unbearable degrees of pain. Your success requires you to keep these patients alive. Tend to the patient\u2019s health through different modules of the <i>DREAMCATCHER</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057180/extras/1ca37651b27d1ac0aec097642df3f3e1.avif?t=1760548385\" width=600 height=75 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057180/extras/e27cea1a02b97194f907d7071a6c1dca.poster.avif?t=1760548385\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057180/extras/e27cea1a02b97194f907d7071a6c1dca.webm?t=1760548385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057180/extras/e27cea1a02b97194f907d7071a6c1dca.mp4?t=1760548385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Too many questions, too little time. The Higher Order Bureau can\u2019t hand you all the information at once. All you know is that, according to them, your work is vital, and that you are in this operating room by your own choice.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Indiscernible mechanisms, things popping in and out of sight, dissonance in the way things are versus the way things should be. There\u2019s something odd about your work, about this place, and about these patients. It's up to you to figure out what that is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Where do you see yourself, Doctor?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up-close interfacing with strange machinery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mixed first-person and point-and-click experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read thoughts of patients; explore their past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep composure whilst things break.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological and body horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short narrative-driven experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rat that craves more cheese??</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4057180?t=1760548385","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4057180?t=1760548385","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057180/db49967becde7244b7b3bfaf427760d7f9f88d23/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760548385","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057180/db49967becde7244b7b3bfaf427760d7f9f88d23/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760548385","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"descript