0/extras/e27cea1a02b97194f907d7071a6c1dca.mp4?t=1760548385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Too many questions, too little time. The Higher Order Bureau can\u2019t hand you all the information at once. All you know is that, according to them, your work is vital, and that you are in this operating room by your own choice.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Indiscernible mechanisms, things popping in and out of sight, dissonance in the way things are versus the way things should be. There\u2019s something odd about your work, about this place, and about these patients. It's up to you to figure out what that is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Where do you see yourself, Doctor?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up-close interfacing with strange machinery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mixed first-person and point-and-click experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read thoughts of patients; explore their past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep composure whilst things break.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological and body horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short narrative-driven experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rat that craves more cheese??</p></li></ul>","developers":["BRYGD Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057180/9c6ea915bf64cc2e2c838b20e7f38d38a357e3ca/header.jpg?t=1760548385","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 800 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Subject to chan